From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:27:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1579/3799] soh: rename func_80A3F908 -> EnGo_RunTalkUpdate

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the per-frame talk driver: for the states that can be spoken to it scales the interact range by the Goron's own size and calls EnGo_UpdateTalking for the big-Goron variant or Npc_UpdateTalking otherwise. Named RunTalkUpdate because both EnGo_UpdateTalking and EnGo_UpdateTalkState already exist as the routines it calls.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go/z_en_go.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go/z_en_go.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go/z_en_go.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go/z_en_go.c
index 52ec88538..a5f556c09 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go/z_en_go.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go/z_en_go.c
@@ -583,7 +583,8 @@ s32 EnGo_IsRollingOnGround(EnGo* this, s16 unkArg1, f32 unkArg2) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_80A3F908(EnGo* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A3F908: the per-frame talk driver: for the states that can be spoken to it scales the interact range by the Goron's own size and calls EnGo_UpdateTalking for the big-Goron variant or Npc_UpdateTalking otherwise. Named RunTalkUpdate because both EnGo_UpdateTalking and EnGo_UpdateTalkState already exist as the routines it calls.
+void EnGo_RunTalkUpdate(EnGo* this, PlayState* play) {
     Player* player = GET_PLAYER(play);
     f32 interactRange;
     s32 dialogStarted;
@@ -1053,7 +1054,7 @@ void EnGo_Update(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
 
     Actor_UpdateBgCheckInfo(play, &this->actor, 0.0f, 0.0f, 0.0f, 4);
     EnGo_UpdateEyes(this);  // was func_80A3F0E4 [LLM:HIGH]
-    func_80A3F908(this, play);
+    EnGo_RunTalkUpdate(this, play);  // was func_80A3F908 [LLM:HIGH]
     this->actionFunc(this, play);
     EnGo_TrackPlayer(this, play);  // was func_80A3F060 [LLM:HIGH]
 }
